{"reviews":[{"id":"B00XJGJO1I-0","r":3.0,"t":"I absolutely love this hair tie because of the sparkle it adds ...","x":"I absolutely love this hair tie because of the sparkle it adds to my otherwise lacking work uniform but my hair gets caught in between the sparkles and gets ripped. You have to be very careful when putting this on and taking it off. I found it easiest to wear this over the top of another thinner black hair tie as the hair is already gathered and you have less chance of the ornament grabbing your hair.","h":13,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2017"},{"id":"B00XJGJO1I-1","r":5.0,"t":"it looks very pretty in my natural reddish hair","x":"Designer Fashion Elastic Rhinestone Hairtie... I wanted a hair tie for an adult to wear in the evening.  This fits that bill and when my hair dresser puts it on me; it looks very pretty in my natural reddish hair.  I like it very much and would not hesitate buying it again.","h":5,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2017"},{"id":"B00XJGJO1I-2","r":5.0,"t":"Gorgeous hair tie!!!","x":"This hair tie is stunning, especially for the price. It's very sparkly and looks expensive, like something from a high end shop. (The seller's picture does not do it justice.) Excellent value. You will not be disappointed!!!","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2016"},{"id":"B00XJGJO1I-3","r":5.0,"t":"Pretty but I had to return","x":"It was pretty but had to return it because it arrived too late for the wedding I attended that I  was going to wear it to.","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2015"},{"id":"B00XJGJO1I-4","r":5.0,"t":"Five Stars","x":"This designer elastic rhinestone ponytail holder is AWESOME!! Better than what I expected. Just beautiful","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2016"},{"id":"B00XJGJO1I-5","r":5.0,"t":"Every nice bling for ponytail","x":"These bling hair elastic are very nice. The metal bling piece bends to fit ponytail or other hair pulled back. Do their price they are very nice, look pretty in hair. They arrived on time and package very nicely. I had no issues at all.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2016"},{"id":"B00XJGJO1I-6","r":5.0,"t":"Five Stars","x":"Beautiful and holds the hair great. Not cheap looking!","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2016"},{"id":"B00XJGJO1I-7","r":3.0,"t":"Three Stars","x":"Great for little girl.  On the small side.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2017"},{"id":"B00XJGJO1I-8","r":4.0,"t":"Looks good/ elastic won\u2019t hold up too long","x":"Looks fantastic! The only problem is the elastic sometimes gets caught on the rhinestones and is starting to pull threads out if the elastic band if not careful and gets frayed. We\u2019ve used it about 4 times so far.. hoping to be able to finish the dance season using it though.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2019"},{"id":"B00XJGJO1I-9","r":4.0,"t":"but overall looks very beautiful. I'm happy with this hair piece","x":"One small section of the stones turned yellow for some reason, but overall looks very beautiful. I'm happy with this hair piece, intended for my 10 year old who loved it.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"May 2017"},{"id":"B00XJGJO1I-10","r":4.0,"t":"pretty","x":"Looks nice. Regular band, wish the band was a little more heavy duty.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2016"},{"id":"B00XJGJO1I-11","r":5.0,"t":"Five Stars","x":"love this for some bling in my hair when I get dressed up","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2017"},{"id":"B00XJGJO1I-12","r":4.0,"t":"Four Stars","x":"Looks inexpensive, but is inexpensive.  No surprises.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2018"},{"id":"B00XJGJO1I-13","r":4.0,"t":"It is beautiful, but would prefer it to be more like ...","x":"This is a backup piece for my daughter's pageant hair accessories.  It is beautiful, but would prefer it to be more like a ponytail barrette than the band. But that is my preference, still a great hair accessory.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"May 2017"},{"id":"B00XJGJO1I-14","r":5.0,"t":"very pretty","x":"This ponytail holder is very pretty and sparkly. It was difficult to use as a ponytail holder, so I put my hair up with a scrunchie and placed this over the scrunchie. It really dresses up a ponytail.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2020"},{"id":"B00XJGJO1I-15","r":5.0,"t":"Exceeded my expectations","x":"This elastic band is beautiful, and it was a staple in my holiday \u201cwardrobe.\u201d  I will enjoy wearing it even to work.  This piece compares favorably to other much more pricey ones I already had.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2020"},{"id":"B00XJGJO1I-16","r":1.0,"t":"Broke","x":"Wore one twice . However the first time I wore it came apart on one side . The second Time I wore it the entire diamond stud came completely off. Although it is very pretty . I couldn't enjoy \ud83d\ude29","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2018"},{"id":"B00XJGJO1I-17","r":5.0,"t":"Bling for your hair","x":"Love this bling for my hair. Brightens up an every day hairstyle and brings a bit of sparkle into your dsy. Bought 2 of these and wear them often. Love it!!!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2017"},{"id":"B00XJGJO1I-18","r":1.0,"t":"Junk","x":"Used it once and rhinestones fell out. I tried to return it and it says not eligible t it'll return....how convenient","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2019"},{"id":"B00XJGJO1I-19","r":1.0,"t":"Arrived broken","x":"Wanted to return because it arrived broken however apparently it's not an item that can be returned. What a waste.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2018"},{"id":"B00XJGJO1I-20","r":5.0,"t":"Very flexible and just the right amount of bling","x":"I like it because it goes on just like a rubberband -- the decorations don't prevent it from being flexible.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2016"},{"id":"B00XJGJO1I-21","r":1.0,"t":"Poorly made","x":"Very poor rubber band attachment. Wore it twice and it broke! Got a lot of compliments but won't buy again!","h":0,"v":0,"d":"Dec 2017"},{"id":"B00XJGJO1I-22","r":5.0,"t":"Very pretty! My hair is a bit thin and still ...","x":"Very pretty ! My hair is a bit thin and still holds my ponytail perfectly. Exactly what I was looking for!","h":0,"v":0,"d":"Apr 2017"},{"id":"B00XJGJO1I-23","r":1.0,"t":"Not for me..","x":"I have long hair and the little crystals always get stuck in it so bad. I wore it once and threw it away.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2017"},{"id":"B00XJGJO1I-24","r":5.0,"t":"It was beautiful and the quality was nice","x":"My granddaughter was in a wedding and she wore this in her hair.  It looked beautiful and worked welk","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2019"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Reviewers frequently describe the hair tie as beautiful, sparkly, and looking expensive for the price.","cites":[2,3,5,6,7,12,15]},{"text":"Several reviewers note the rhinestones catch or snag hair and the elastic, requiring care when putting it on or taking it off.","cites":[1,9,15]},{"text":"Some reviewers find the band or size on the small/light side and wish it were more heavy duty.","cites":[8,11]},{"text":"A few reviewers mention quality issues like stones turning yellow or the elastic fraying over time.","cites":[9,10]},{"text":"Some reviewers note it looks inexpensive or arrived too late for their intended event.","cites":[4,13]}]},"qa":[]}